'''''Centaurea hermannii''''', is a [[perennial]] [[herbaceous]] plant belonging to the genus ''[[Centaurea]]'' of the family [[Asteraceae]]. It is an endemic plant<ref>S. Öksüz, S. Serin & G. Topçu (1994)[http://openagricola.nal.usda.gov/Record/IND20602524 Sesquiterpene lactones from Centaurea hermannii] {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160304052210/http://openagricola.nal.usda.gov/Record/IND20602524 |date=2016-03-04 }}</ref> of [[Turkey]] and found only in [[Çatalca Peninsula]], and threatened by [[habitat loss]].

